  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avian Influenza Control Project - Additional Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims strengthening capacity of the country to minimize the risk of further spreading of the Avian Influenza Virus (AIV) to either animals or humans and finally control the disease by establishing a vaccine production facility that complements the already accomplished related prevention activities under the original loan including quality control facilities, Cold chain facilities for the distribution of vaccine, IT and communication equipment, and training.</narrative>
  </description>
